{"seq":2,"slug":"evaluation-engine-functions-aggregation","title":"求值引擎：步进求值、函数、聚合与子查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/query-promql-execution/evaluation-engine-functions-aggregation","wordCount":2642,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"求值引擎-步进求值-函数-聚合与子查询\">求值引擎：步进求值、函数、聚合与子查询</h1><p>同一句 <code>rate(http_requests_total[5m])</code> 在表视图里返回一个数、在绘图里返回 1440 个数，差别不在表达式，而在<strong>求值引擎的驱动方式</strong>：范围查询把一个实例查询在 start 到 end 之间按固定步长反复跑一遍。决定一次查询成本、一个告警是否误报、一个 <code>histogram_quantile</code> 是否可信的，是引擎在那条步进网格上如何取值、如何外推、如何对齐子查询。本文只谈求值与执行，指标与样本模型见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../tsdb-model-ingestion/metric-label-sample-model\">数据模型与摄取</a>，落盘字节与倒排索引见 <a href=\"../storage-compaction-index/block-chunk-index-format\">块与索引格式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>实例查询 / 范围查询</strong>：前者在单个时间戳求值一次；后者在 <code>[start, end]</code> 上以等间距 <code>step</code> 反复求值，只支持标量或瞬时向量作为根表达式。</li>\n<li><strong>Lookback（回看窗口）</strong>：实例选择器向前搜索最新样本的最大时长，默认 5 分钟。</li>\n<li><strong>Stale（陈旧）</strong>：来源明确停止产出一个序列后的标记，使其在后续求值点不再返回。</li>\n<li><strong>求值器 / Annotation</strong>：执行查询的内部结构持有 <code>lookbackDelta</code>、<code>maxSamples</code>、<code>interval</code> 等参数；求值中附带的 info/warn 级诊断即 annotation。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"求值模型-实例查询与范围查询共用同一套语义\">求值模型：实例查询与范围查询共用同一套语义</h2><p>引擎只有两种入口，语义完全相同。官方原话是「the range query is just like an instant query run multiple times at different timestamps」——范围查询不是另一种算法，只是同一算法跑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(end-start)/step + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>当抓取或规则求值不再产出某个先前存在的序列时，该序列被标记为 <strong>stale</strong>。在 stale 标记之后的求值点，该序列不再返回任何值；若之后又有新样本写入则照常返回。<strong>stale 与 lookback 是两回事</strong>——前者是「来源明确停止产出」，后者是「即使没停，超过 5 分钟也不再前向填充」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[查询表达式] --&gt; T{类型}&#10;    T --&gt;|instant| I[单时间戳求值]&#10;    T --&gt;|range| R[按 step 生成时间戳网格]&#10;    R --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; SEL[向量选择器&lt;br/&gt;取 &lt;= t 的最新样本]&#10;    SEL --&gt; LB{距 t 是否 &lt; 5m}&#10;    LB --&gt;|否| NONE[该序列无值]&#10;    LB --&gt;|是| OK[返回该样本]&#10;    OK --&gt; OP[函数 / 聚合 / 二元运算]&#10;    NONE --&gt; OP&#10;    OP --&gt; OUT[形成结果向量或矩阵]\">graph TD\n    Q[查询表达式] --&gt; T{类型}\n    T --&gt;|instant| I[单时间戳求值]\n    T --&gt;|range| R[按 step 生成时间戳网格]\n    R --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; SEL[向量选择器&lt;br/&gt;取 &lt;= t 的最新样本]\n    SEL --&gt; LB{距 t 是否 &lt; 5m}\n    LB --&gt;|否| NONE[该序列无值]\n    LB --&gt;|是| OK[返回该样本]\n    OK --&gt; OP[函数 / 聚合 / 二元运算]\n    NONE --&gt; OP\n    OP --&gt; OUT[形成结果向量或矩阵]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>控制项</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范围查询步长 <code>step</code></td>\n<td>由调用方给定</td>\n<td>HTTP API / UI</td>\n<td>决定求值次数与结果点数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实例选择器回看窗口</td>\n<td>5m</td>\n<td><code>--query.lookback-delta</code></td>\n<td>旧值前向填充的时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单查询超时</td>\n<td>2m</td>\n<td><code>--query.timeout</code></td>\n<td>超时即中止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发查询数</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td><code>--query.max-concurrency</code></td>\n<td>排队或拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单查询样本上限</td>\n<td>5e7（50000000）</td>\n<td><code>--query.max-samples</code></td>\n<td>超限报 <code>too many samples</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>取值规则的推论：一个每 15s 抓取的序列在某步上本应无样本，引擎仍会用 4 分多钟前的旧值顶上（只要没被标记 stale），从而让 <code>sum</code> 这类跨序列聚合的输入在时间上对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间修饰符-offset-与-改变的是选择器的时间基准\">时间修饰符：offset 与 @ 改变的是选择器的时间基准</h2><p><code>offset</code> 把选择器的时间基准整体平移，<code>@</code> 把它钉死在某个绝对时间。两者都<strong>必须紧贴选择器</strong>：<code>sum(metric offset 5m)</code> 合法，<code>sum(metric) offset 5m</code> 非法——这是解析器把修饰符绑定到向量选择器而非外层表达式的结果。<code>@</code> 接受 Unix 时间戳，也接受 <code>start()</code> 与 <code>end()</code>，在范围查询里它们解析为该查询的起止时间并<strong>在所有步上保持常量</strong>。</p>\n<p><code>@</code> 与 <code>offset</code> 可组合，<code>offset</code> 相对于 <code>@</code> 指定的时间生效且<strong>修饰符顺序不影响结果</strong>。注意 <strong><code>@</code> 与负 offset 允许查询看向未来</strong>（<code>rate(x[5m] offset -1w)</code>），写告警规则时这类表达式并非时间因果安全。</p>\n<p>2026 年的 Prometheus（当前主线 3.14.x，3.14.0 发布于 2026-08-17）已<strong>默认启用时长表达式</strong>（<code>promql-duration-expr</code> 特性标志变为 no-op），范围选择器和 offset 里可直接写算术：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"promql\" data-code=\"rate(http_requests_total[5m * 2])          # 10 分钟窗口&#10;http_requests_total offset (1h / 2)        # 30 分钟偏移，括号必需&#10;max_over_time(metric[range()] @ end())     # 覆盖整个范围查询窗口\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>rate(http_requests_total[5m * 2])          # 10 分钟窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>http_requests_total offset (1h / 2)        # 30 分钟偏移，括号必需</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>max_over_time(metric[range()] @ end())     # 覆盖整个范围查询窗口</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>step()</code> 解析为范围查询的步宽（实例查询为 <code>0s</code>），<code>range()</code> 解析为整个查询范围。<strong>时长表达式不支持写在 <code>@</code> 修饰符里</strong>，这是一条硬边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"函数层-rate-的外推-counter-重置与直方图分位\">函数层：rate 的外推、counter 重置与直方图分位</h2><p><code>rate()</code> 是最被误读的函数。它返回「每秒平均增长率」，并<strong>自动修正 counter 重置</strong>（任何单调性断裂都被当作回绕补回）。核心机制是<strong>向时间范围两端外推</strong>：引擎把窗口内的实际覆盖率外推到边界，以容忍漏抓和抓取周期不对齐。这解释了两个长期争论的现象：整数 counter 的 <code>increase()</code> 会得到非整数（<code>increase(v)</code> 本质上是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>窗口秒数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">rate(v) \\times \\text{窗口秒数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">窗口秒数</span></span></span></span></span></span>，外推按比例放大）；<code>rate()</code> 窗口太短（如 <code>[1m]</code>）会抖动甚至失真，因为最坏情况下窗口里只有 1–2 个样本，外推假设变得脆弱。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>reset</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>extrapolation factor</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">rate = \\frac{v_n - v_0 + \\sum \\text{reset}_i}{t_n - t_0} \\times \\text{extrapolation factor}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reset</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">extrapolation factor</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>外推因子把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n - t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 放大到整个请求窗口。<strong>聚合顺序也有讲究</strong>：应先用 <code>rate()</code> 再聚合（如 <code>sum by (job) (rate(...))</code>），否则目标重启造成的重置会在聚合内部被抹平而检测不到。<code>irate()</code> 只看<strong>最后两个点</strong>算瞬时斜率，适合在图上追踪快速波动的 counter，但对漏抓极敏感，不推荐用于告警。</p>\n<p>直方图分位是查询侧最贵的计算之一。<code>histogram_quantile(φ, b)</code> 接受经典直方图（带 <code>le</code> 标签的一组 <code>_bucket</code> 浮点序列）或原生直方图（每个样本自带完整分箱）。经典直方图求分位时，落在桶内的分位用<strong>线性插值</strong>估计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(\\varphi) = L + \\frac{\\varphi \\cdot N - C_{k-1}}{C_k - C_{k-1}} \\times w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2547em;vertical-align:-0.8943em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是桶下界、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是桶宽、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是累计计数。几条硬规则：经典直方图<strong>至少两个桶</strong>否则返回 <code>NaN</code>；最高桶上界必须为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>，落在最高桶的分位返回次高桶上界。聚合经典直方图时<strong>必须保留 <code>le</code> 标签</strong>（<code>sum by (job, le)</code>），而原生直方图可 <code>sum by (job)</code> 直接聚合，分箱布局由引擎自动对齐。若某序列在同一窗口里既有浮点样本又有原生直方图样本，该序列会被整条丢弃并附 warn 级 annotation。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚合与向量匹配-分组-方向与空结果的语义\">聚合与向量匹配：分组、方向与空结果的语义</h2><p>聚合把瞬时向量压成更少的元素。语法允许子句在前或在后：<code>sum by (job) (x)</code> 与 <code>sum(x) by (job)</code> 等价，<code>without</code> 移除列出的标签、保留其余，<code>by</code> 只保留列出的标签、其余全丢。聚合算子按语义分三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>算子</th>\n<th>关键限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通用聚合</td>\n<td><code>sum</code> <code>avg</code> <code>group</code> <code>count</code></td>\n<td><code>sum</code>/<code>avg</code> 可混合浮点与直方图；混合类型时该组被移除并附 warn</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅浮点</td>\n<td><code>min</code> <code>max</code> <code>stddev</code> <code>stdvar</code> <code>quantile</code></td>\n<td>直方图输入被忽略；<code>quantile</code> 参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">φ&lt;0\\to -Inf</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">φ&gt;1\\to +Inf</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取值型</td>\n<td><code>topk</code> <code>bottomk</code> <code>count_values</code></td>\n<td><code>topk</code>/<code>bottomk</code> 保留原始标签；实例查询排序，范围查询不排序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>count(v)</code> 统计当前时间戳上的取值个数，文档明确「该时间戳无值时完全不返回」，因此 <code>count()</code> 为空的组不会以 0 出现。<code>topk</code>/<code>bottomk</code> 的特殊之处在于 <strong><code>by</code>/<code>without</code> 只负责分组、不改变输出的标签集</strong>，因为要保留被选中样本的原始标签。</p>\n<p>二元运算的向量匹配是另一组陷阱。默认要求标签集<strong>完全相同</strong>才能配对，配不上的元素直接从结果中消失（官方原话：找不到匹配的序列「are not part of the result」）。<code>on(&lt;labels&gt;)</code> 收敛匹配维度，<code>ignoring(&lt;labels&gt;)</code> 排除维度。一对多关系<strong>必须显式声明</strong>：<code>group_left</code> 表示左侧是「多」的一方，<code>group_right</code> 表示右侧是「多」的一方，可在修饰符后追加要带入输出的「一」侧标签，但这类修饰符对 <code>and</code>/<code>or</code>/<code>unless</code> 无效。</p>\n<p>比较运算符默认是<strong>过滤</strong>语义：<code>&gt;</code> 只保留为真的元素，为假的丢弃。要不要 <code>bool</code> 决定了输出是过滤还是 0/1，两侧都是标量时必须用 <code>bool</code>。用 <code>on</code> 会丢弃左侧指标名，用 <code>group_right</code> 则保留右侧指标名以防冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"子查询-在时间轴上嵌套一次查询\">子查询：在时间轴上嵌套一次查询</h2><p>子查询让一个<strong>实例查询</strong>在一个范围上以给定分辨率反复执行，结果是一个范围向量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"promql\" data-code=\"&lt;instant_query&gt; &#39;[&#39; &lt;range&gt; &#39;:&#39; [&lt;resolution&gt;] &#39;]&#39; [ @ &lt;float_literal&gt; ] [ offset &lt;float_literal&gt; ]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;instant_query> '[' &#x3C;range> ':' [&#x3C;resolution>] ']' [ @ &#x3C;float_literal> ] [ offset &#x3C;float_literal> ]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>分辨率为可选，省略时默认取<strong>全局求值间隔</strong>。例如 <code>max_over_time(rate(http_requests_total[5m])[30m:1m])</code> 表示：对最近 30 分钟，每 1 分钟算一次 5 分钟 <code>rate()</code>，再对这批点取最大值。典型用途是给 <code>rate</code>、<code>deriv</code> 这类瞬时函数套上 <code>_over_time</code>。</p>\n<p>引擎实现上，子查询被求值为一个<strong>独立的子求值器</strong>（child evaluator），按自己的步长网格对齐：起点从 <code>startTimestamp - offset - range</code> 之后<strong>第一个对齐到子查询间隔的网格点</strong>开始。结果是子查询的采样点<strong>不会与父查询的步网格重合对齐</strong>——它有自己的网格，只在时间上被裁到父窗口内，这解释了为什么有时子查询的样本数与直觉不符。若子查询上带 <code>@</code> 修饰符，它会<strong>覆盖</strong>父级的时间范围设置；2025 年引入的扩展范围选择器（<code>anchored</code>、<code>smoothed</code>）<strong>不支持用在子查询里</strong>。</p>\n<p>子查询是最容易造成样本量爆炸的构造：外层范围查询有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 步，内层子查询每步又展开 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个采样点，总量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个中间样本，且全部计入 <code>--query.max-samples</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资源边界与慢查询治理\">资源边界与慢查询治理</h2><p>所有求值都受一组硬上限约束，超限即失败而非降级。最直接的一条是样本数：引擎在求值过程中累加 <code>ev.currentSamples</code>，一旦超过 <code>ev.maxSamples</code> 立即返回 <code>ErrTooManySamples</code>，错误信息为「query processing would load too many samples into memory in ...」。默认上限由 <code>--query.max-samples</code> 给出，为 <strong>50000000</strong>（5e7）。它的含义是<strong>中间样本总量</strong>，不是返回点数——一个返回单个数的 <code>sum</code> 也可能因为聚合了上百万输入序列而触顶。</p>\n<p>围绕这条上限的工程实践已成惯例：<strong>先在表视图验证再切图</strong>（官方建议结果控制在「数百条，而非数千条」时间序列，绘图默认还有约 11000 点的 UI 侧上限）；<strong>过滤落在选择器上而非靠聚合兜底</strong>（<code>api_http_requests_total</code> 这类裸指标名可能展开成千上万条序列，聚合虽只输出少量结果，输入规模仍决定负载）；<strong>重查询下沉为 recording rule</strong>；<strong><code>smoothed</code> 在规则里要配 <code>query_offset</code></strong>，因为它需要求值窗口之后的样本才能插值，直接用会系统性<strong>低估</strong>结果。</p>\n<p>并发与超时是另两条边界：<code>--query.max-concurrency</code> 默认 <strong>20</strong>，超过的查询排队；<code>--query.timeout</code> 默认 <strong>2m</strong>，超时即中止。这三者加上 <code>--query.lookback-delta</code>（5m）构成了 PromQL 引擎的四条基本护栏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-求值成本的因子分解\">小结：求值成本的因子分解</h2><p>一次查询的开销 ≈ 步数 × 每步的输入序列数 × 每序列的窗口样本数，而四类护栏分别削减这几个因子：<code>step</code> 控制步数、选择器过滤与 <code>on</code>/<code>by</code> 控制序列数、<code>[5m]</code> 与子查询分辨率控制窗口样本数、<code>max-samples</code> 与 <code>timeout</code> 在总账上兜底。理解 <code>rate()</code> 的外推假设与子查询的独立网格，是从「会写 PromQL」到「能诊断 PromQL 为什么贵、为什么不准」的分界线。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"求值引擎：步进求值、函数、聚合与子查询","id":"求值引擎-步进求值-函数-聚合与子查询"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"求值模型：实例查询与范围查询共用同一套语义","id":"求值模型-实例查询与范围查询共用同一套语义"},{"level":2,"text":"时间修饰符：offset 与 @ 改变的是选择器的时间基准","id":"时间修饰符-offset-与-改变的是选择器的时间基准"},{"level":2,"text":"函数层：rate 的外推、counter 重置与直方图分位","id":"函数层-rate-的外推-counter-重置与直方图分位"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合与向量匹配：分组、方向与空结果的语义","id":"聚合与向量匹配-分组-方向与空结果的语义"},{"level":2,"text":"子查询：在时间轴上嵌套一次查询","id":"子查询-在时间轴上嵌套一次查询"},{"level":2,"text":"资源边界与慢查询治理","id":"资源边界与慢查询治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：求值成本的因子分解","id":"小结-求值成本的因子分解"}],"prev":{"title":"PromQL 数据模型：向量类型、选择器与 lookback 语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/query-promql-execution/promql-vector-selector-semantics"},"next":{"title":"查询优化与防护：索引选择、超时控制与 OOM 治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/query-promql-execution/query-optimization-limits-oom"}}